node_modules/
dist/
.captures/

# Scratch scripts from debugging sessions are named with a leading underscore
# and are never meant to survive the session that made them.
scripts/_*

# public/atlas/ is deliberately committed - generated art is reviewable,
# diffable, and hand-editable via src/art/overrides/. The atlas is produced
# deterministically from ART_SEED, so a diff there means the art actually
# changed, which is exactly what you want to see in review.
# See the art-synthesis skill.
